aring for professional events.","evidence_claim":"The Polar Career Center says its Career Closet resource is offered free of charge to ONU students.","source_url":"https://www.onu.edu/student-life/polar-career-center","source_title":"Polar Career Center | Ohio Northern University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"For ONU students; arrange a time with Polar Career Center staff. The office is on Heterick Memorial Library’s second floor.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"onu-handshake-career-platform","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"ONU Handshake Career Platform","title":"Build a Handshake profile side by side","subtitle":"Online career-exploration activity","notes":"Use your ONU email to create an account with a friend, fill in interests, and browse the platform’s job, internship, employer, and virtual-event options.","short_summary":"A free online career platform for ONU students.","evidence_claim":"ONU’s Polar Careers page instructs students to create a free Handshake account using their .edu email address.","source_url":"https://www.onu.edu/student-life/polar-careers/career-exploration-and-resources","source_title":"Career Exploration and Resources | Ohio Northern University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Requires an ONU .edu email address to create the free account.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"onu-vita-tax-assistance","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"ONU Volunteer Income Tax Assistance Program","title":"Book free VITA tax-prep help","subtitle":"Dicke College of Business Administration","notes":"If you meet the income guideline, ask about ONU’s VITA service and bring required tax documents; business students prepare returns for Ada residents and fellow students.","short_summary":"Free tax-return preparation for eligible local residents and students.","evidence_claim":"ONU describes its VITA program as providing free tax-return preparation for individuals and families making about $70,000 or less annually.","source_url":"https://www.onu.edu/student-stories/justin-zollars-vita-volunteer","source_title":"Justin Zollars: VITA volunteer | Ohio Northern University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Eligibility is income-limited; confirm seasonal appointment details and required documents with the Dicke College of Business Administration.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"onu-student-health-clinic","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"ONU Student Health Clinic","title":"Use the free walk-in health clinic","subtitle":"Available to all ONU students","notes":"If you need non-emergency care, use the walk-in clinic for an assessment, treatment, or referral; consider inviting a trusted friend to accompany you if appropriate.","short_summary":"A student-accessible walk-in clinic for general health support.","evidence_claim":"ONU states that it has a free walk-in health clinic available to all students for general assessments, treatments, and referrals.","source_url":"https://www.onu.edu/student-success-center/international-services","source_title":"International Services | Ohio Northern University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"For ONU students; this is a health service rather than a social venue. Use emergency services for emergencies.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"onu-residence-hall-common-area-laundry","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"ONU Residence Hall Common-Area Laundry","title":"Do a no-charge laundry reset","subtitle":"Residence-hall common areas","notes":"Use your residence hall’s common-area machines during a planned reset with roommates; bring your own supplies and follow your building’s shared-space expectations.","short_summary":"A practical, no-charge shared facility for residential students.","evidence_claim":"ONU states that residence-hall common areas include high-efficiency laundry machines with no charge for use.","source_url":"https://www.onu.edu/student-life/housing","source_title":"Housing | Ohio Northern University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"For ONU residence-hall students and their assigned building’s common areas; laundry supplies are not stated as provided.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":["Some options are student-only or event-specific; review the cited source and current campus communications before going."]}],"warnings":[]}
